      { who: "A", text: "Today I want to talk about how sleep affects learning. Research shows that adults need between seven and nine hours of sleep each night.", vi: "H\xF4m nay t\xF4i n\xF3i v\u1EC1 \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng c\u1EE7a gi\u1EA5c ng\u1EE7 \u0111\u1EBFn vi\u1EC7c h\u1ECDc. Nghi\xEAn c\u1EE9u cho th\u1EA5y ng\u01B0\u1EDDi l\u1EDBn c\u1EA7n t\u1EEB b\u1EA3y \u0111\u1EBFn ch\xEDn ti\u1EBFng ng\u1EE7 m\u1ED7i \u0111\xEAm." },
      { who: "A", text: "During deep sleep, the brain moves information from short-term to long-term memory, which is why students who sleep after studying remember more.", vi: "Trong gi\u1EA5c ng\u1EE7 s\xE2u, n\xE3o chuy\u1EC3n th\xF4ng tin t\u1EEB tr\xED nh\u1EDB ng\u1EAFn h\u1EA1n sang d\xE0i h\u1EA1n, v\xEC v\u1EADy sinh vi\xEAn ng\u1EE7 sau khi h\u1ECDc nh\u1EDB nhi\u1EC1u h\u01A1n." },
      { who: "A", text: "In one experiment, a group who slept for eight hours scored twenty percent higher on a memory test than a group who stayed awake all night.", vi: "Trong m\u1ED9t th\xED nghi\u1EC7m, nh\xF3m ng\u1EE7 t\xE1m ti\u1EBFng \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111i\u1EC3m ki\u1EC3m tra tr\xED nh\u1EDB cao h\u01A1n hai m\u01B0\u01A1i ph\u1EA7n tr\u0103m so v\u1EDBi nh\xF3m th\u1EE9c tr\u1EAFng \u0111\xEAm." },
      { who: "A", text: "To improve sleep quality, experts recommend avoiding screens for an hour before bed and keeping the bedroom cool and dark.", vi: "\u0110\u1EC3 c\u1EA3i thi\u1EC7n ch\u1EA5t l\u01B0\u1EE3ng gi\u1EA5c ng\u1EE7, chuy\xEAn gia khuy\xEAn tr\xE1nh m\xE0n h\xECnh m\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi ng\u1EE7 v\xE0 gi\u1EEF ph\xF2ng m\xE1t v\xE0 t\u1ED1i." }
