  "M\u1ED7i \u0111o\u1EA1n th\xE2n b\xE0i: 1 \xFD ch\xEDnh + gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch + v\xED d\u1EE5.",
  "D\xF9ng t\u1EEB n\u1ED1i \u0111\u1EC3 d\u1EABn d\u1EAFt \xFD (However, Furthermore, As a result).",
