        ["What do critics say about the concrete in the buildings?", "Producing it releases more carbon than the plants absorb for years.", "It is not strong enough to hold the trees.", "It prevents birds from nesting.", "It makes the apartments too hot.", "\u0110o\u1EA1n cu\u1ED1i: b\xEA t\xF4ng t\u1EA1o ra nhi\u1EC1u carbon h\u01A1n l\u01B0\u1EE3ng c\xE2y h\u1EA5p th\u1EE5 trong nhi\u1EC1u n\u0103m."],
        ["What argument do supporters give?", "Cities have little land available for new parks.", "Street trees do not absorb carbon.", "Vertical forests are cheap to build.", "Residents prefer balconies to parks.", '"land for new parks is scarce in crowded cities".']
