        ["London taxi drivers must memorise about twenty-five thousand ____.", ["streets"], "\u0110o\u1EA1n 3."],
        ["Children who are allowed to ____ on their own develop better mental maps.", ["explore"], "\u0110o\u1EA1n 6."]
